# ── portal frontend (React + Vite) — no runtime environment ────────────────
# The portal is now a static React/Vite SPA served by nginx; it talks to the
# FastAPI control-plane through the `/api` proxy (vite dev) / nginx reverse
# proxy (prod). The SPA reads NO build-time env vars — only Vite's built-in
# `import.meta.env.BASE_URL` (sourced from the `base` option in vite.config.js),
# never from this file — so it is intentionally empty.
#
# All server-side configuration (database, auth/JWT, object store, AI/Foundry,
# usage limits, deck conversion) now lives in the FastAPI backend.
# See backend/.env.example.
